            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Greyhound Cafe",
            "review_text": "ECM\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam178 contributions\n0\nA delightful experience\nApr 2021\nWe came to check it out and we were impressed with the coziness of the restaurant with its grayish color interior with high ceiling. Their specialty food is Thai cuisine which actually does not match their restaurant name. What is good is they have a happy hour buy one take cocktail drink from 5pm to 8pm and I would recommend the Whiskey Sour and Mojito as the taste is very good! We tried pad thai noodle and another one which my partner had but I forgot the name. The service was efficient and they have enough service staff to follow through customers need. Overall, we were happy and will surely come back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 20, 2021",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
