            "review_title": "Review at Greyhound Cafe",
            "review_text": "lonngh\n4 contributions\n1\nGreat ambiance but not much else\nFeb 2020\nThe service was good and the ambiance was brilliant, the restaurant felt contemporary but also classic with gorgeous, modern designs across the walls and in the menu. However, I was particularly surprised at how salty the pasta was, to the point where I felt dehydrated after my meal. I would return to try their other dishes but I had a mixed reaction on first impressions.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 17, 2020",
