            "review_title": "Review at Greyhound Cafe",
            "review_text": "LPN\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam82 contributions\n1\nVery good service\nFeb 2020 • Solo\nBeen seeing this place for weeks while it was under construction. I decided to stop by and ordered the duck noodle soup. Food was wonderfully flavored but I thought the portion size was a bit small. The service is attentive and outstanding. It is clear that they are well trained. Happy hour is buy one get one free for alcoholic drinks. I will come back here!\nWritten February 12, 2020",
