            "review_title": "Review at Greyhound Cafe",
            "review_text": "OldbutSane\n116 contributions\n0\nOverpriced\nFeb 2020\nStopped here for a coffee and was hesitant to order as a cafe latte was 65000 VND. Service was very slow and they left the coffee made on the bench for some time before bringing it to the table. Went to pay at counter and were told to sit back down and thy\nYes would bring the bill. Surprise was when they gave us the bill it cost nearly 90000VND, an outrageous amount for a small latte, way more than we would pay at home. Most cafe prices here include service and VAT.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 6, 2020",
